## LOOM, a live looper for Mac

LOOM is live looping software for macOS (Apple Silicon, macOS 13.3 or later). It records and overdubs audio on five loop tracks like a hardware loop pedal, and loops MIDI on four instrument tracks that play its own synth, drum machine and sampler. Its arrange view lets you draw REC, DUB and PLAY regions on a timeline, so the song presses the looper's buttons while you play over it. It has a mixer with eight insert slots per strip and built-in effects, records a performance to separate synced WAV files, is controlled from MIDI notes, and makes no network calls. Latest version: {{ releases.latest.version }}. Price: {% include "components/loom-price.njk" %}. 14-day free trial with every feature unlocked.

